      "omegaBannerUrl": "",
      "readmeExcerpt": "# Select Next Loot Item (Without VanillaPlus)\n\nA minimal Dalamud plugin that automatically selects the next loot item in the **Need/Greed/Pass** window.\n\n## What It Does\n\n- Selects the first unrolled item when the Need/Greed window opens.\n- After you click **Need** or **Greed**, it automatically moves selection to the next item.\n- After **Pass**, it moves to the next item only when the current item had not already been rolled.\n\n## Why This Exists\n\nThis plugin is for users who only want the loot-item auto-selection behavior without running VanillaPlus.\n\n## Installation\n\n1. Open Dalamud settings.\n2. Go to Experimental settings.\n3. Add this URL to custom plugin repositories:\n   - `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Catphinaud/DalamudPlugins/refs/heads/main/pluginmaster.json`\n4. Open the Plugin Installer.\n5. Find **Select Next Loot Item (Without VanillaPlus)** and install it.\n\n## Notes\n\n- This plugin only handles selection in the Loot UI.\n- It does not automatically choose Need/Greed/Pass for you.\n\n## Credits\n\n- Name and scope reference: [VanillaPlus by MidoriKami](https://github.com/MidoriKami/VanillaPlus)\n\n## License\n\nAGPL-3.0-or-later. See `LICENSE.md`.",
      "title": "SelectNextLootItem",
      "url": "https://github.com/Catphinaud/SelectNextLootItem"
    }
  },
